  "servings": 4,
  "summary": "These exquisite <b>Peruvian smoked trout dumplings</b> bring together the rich culinary heritage of coastal Peru with delicately steamed pastry pockets. Flaky trout, infused with deep hickory smoke flavor, serves as the heart of the filling, paired with smooth cream cheese that creates a silky inner texture. Smoked aji amarillo chili paste introduces a characteristic Andean warm pepper fruitiness and vibrant orange hue without overwhelming the delicate seafood. Bright accents of fresh lime zest, diced sweet red pepper, and crisp green onions cut through the rich filling, adding texture and aroma to every bite. Wrapped in thin wheat pastry skins, the dumplings are gently steamed inside bamboo baskets to lock in moisture and heat without frying. As steam penetrates the thin dough wrapper, the savory filling warms into a luscious center. Served hot alongside a simple dipping sauce of dark soy sauce and toasted sesame oil, these handcrafted dumplings provide a delicate balance of smokiness, citrus brightness, and savory satisfaction.",
